<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss Re to open rep office in Shanghai.</title>
<headline>Swiss Re to open rep office in Shanghai.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Reinsurance Co said it had won approval from Chinese authorities to open a representative office in Shanghai.</p>
<p>Swiss Re said the new office would be its second in China after a representation in Beijing set up early this year.</p>
<p>&quot;The Shangahi office will further strengthen Swiss Re's relationship with local insurance companies by providing on-the-spot service and expertise,&quot; a Swiss Re statement said.</p>
<p>It said Shanghai would raise the number of Swiss Re representative offices in the Asia-Pacific region to 10.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
</text>
